# The frontend has NO secrets, and must not be given any.
#
# Everything Vite reads at build time is inlined into the JavaScript it ships,
# so an API key placed here would be readable by anyone who opens the site.
# The AI keys belong to the backend and are configured in server/.env — see
# server/.env.example.
#
# The site talks to its own /api/... paths, same-origin, so it needs no base
# URL either. In development, vite.config.ts forwards /api to the local server.
#
# There is deliberately nothing to set here.
